Looking at your codeplug I can see that you have many channels for each DMR repeater. Each one with a different Talkgroup / timeslot. <br><br>With OpenGD77 that is not necessary. Just define one channel for each repeater and assign a talkgroup list to the channel which contains all of the required talkgroups.  Several repeaters can usually share the same talkgroup list.  <br><br>Switching timeslot is also easy on OpenGD77 just by pressing the * key, so it is not really necessary to have a channel for each timeslot. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Sun Jul 21, 2024 3:44 pm</p><hr />
